      `<option value="sector_2">Sector II — Opportunistic &amp; Nosocomial</option>` +
      `<option value="sector_3">Sector III — Mycobacteria &amp; Endemic Fungi</option>` +
      `<option value="sector_4">Sector IV — Respiratory Viruses</option>` +
